{"sections":[{"slug":"带弱等价的范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"带弱等价的范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">带弱等价的范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"带弱等价的范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">带弱等价的范畴是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">无穷范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的一种</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/数学对象的表现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">表现</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">方式</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">可通过</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴的局部化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴的局部化</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">变为</span> ∞-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">一个具体的模型是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Dwyer–Kan单纯局部化","text":"Dwyer–Kan <span lang=\"zh\">单纯局部化</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">它将一个带弱等价的范畴变为单纯充实范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">无穷范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的一个模型</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">带弱等价的范畴之间的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">保持弱等价</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的函子可用于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/数学对象的表现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">表现</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对应的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴","text":"$\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">之间的函子</span>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">对于某些不保持弱等价的函子</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也可以通过谨慎地选择等价类的代表来得到</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴","text":"$\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">之间的函子</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">带弱等价的范畴</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是指一个范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">带有一族指定的态射</span> $W$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中包含</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中所有的同构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">满足某些封闭性质</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">如三选二性质</span>, $f,g,gf$ <span lang=\"zh\">中任意两者属于</span> $W$ <span lang=\"zh\">则第三者属于</span> $W$).</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">链复形</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/链复形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">链复形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟同构","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟同构</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是一种弱等价</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这表现了</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/链复形无穷范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">链复形</span> $\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}